    {
      "id": "n000000mainrs000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -660,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### main.rs\nEntry point, calls `run()`"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000librs0000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -660,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### lib.rs\n- **CLI parsing** (tauri-plugin-cli)\n- **Config** — TOML at `~/.config/canvim/config.toml`\n- **Canvas types** — `Canvas { nodes, edges }`, `Node` enum, `Edge`\n- **AppState** — `file_path`, `config` (immutable after init)\n- **Tauri commands**: `init`, `log`, `read_canvas`, `save_canvas`",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g0000000stores00",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 700,
      "label": "State Layer (src/lib/stores/)",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n00000storeindex",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "### index.ts — getStore()\nAssembles all sub-stores into one unified reactive interface",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n0000canvasdata0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### canvas-data\n- `nodes[]`, `edges[]`\n- `filePath`, `config`\n- `clipboard`, undo/redo\n- Tauri `invoke()` calls\n- `debouncedSave()` (500ms)\n- CRUD: add/update/remove\n- `yankSelected`, `paste`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000mode00000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### mode\nState machine:\nnormal | insert | move |\nresize | connect | search |\nvisual\n`implicitSelect` flag",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000selection0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -60,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### selection\n`selectedNodeIds[]`\n`selectedEdgeId`\n`cycleNode()`, `toggleNode()`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000viewport00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -20,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### viewport\n`{ x, y, zoom }`\n`screenToCanvas()`\n`zoomAtPoint()`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000connect000",
