      "text": "### visual\n`visualOrigin`\n`confirmVisual()`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g0000000componen",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 540,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 700,
      "label": "View Layer (src/lib/)",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000canvas0000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "### Canvas.svelte\nCentral orchestrator:\n- Dot-grid background\n- SVG edge layer + node layer\n- All keyboard/mouse events\n- `buildKeyMap` dispatch\n- Pan acceleration\n- Input mode (mouse/keyboard)",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000node000000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### Node.svelte\n- Renders text/file/link/group\n- Insert mode → CodeMirror\n- Zoomed-out → heading overlay\n- Normal → `marked.parse()` HTML\n- Color via `resolveColor()`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000edge000000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### Edge.svelte\n- SVG bezier path rendering\n- Auto-detect sides\n- Hit-box path (16px stroke)\n- Optional arrowhead + label\n- Uses `geometry.ts`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000mdedit0000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "### MarkdownEditor.svelte\nCodeMirror 6 editor\n- Markdown language\n- Syntax highlighting\n- Escape → exit insert\n- stopPropagation",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000subcomps00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "### UI Components\n- **Crosshair** — center cursor\n- **StatusBar** — mode, pos, hints\n- **SearchBar** — search overlay\n- **VisualRect** — selection rect\n- **ConnectPreview** — edge preview\n- **EdgeLabelEditor** — inline edit",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "g0000000logic0000",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 220,
      "label": "Logic Modules (src/lib/)",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000commands00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### commands.ts\n`Command` interface\n`buildKeyMap(config)`\n→ `Map<\"mode:key\", Command[]>`\n`getHints()` for status bar\nAll keybindings defined here",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000geometry00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### geometry.ts\n`attachmentPoint`, `autoSides`\n`bezierPath`, `bezierMidpoint`\n`nodesInRect`, `findNodeAt`\n`distToEdge`, `getEdgeNear`\n`snap()` to STEP grid",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000utilsmd000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1080,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "### utils.ts & markdown.ts\n`getNodeText()`\n`getNodeHeadingOrFirstLine()`\n`marked` + `highlight.js`\n### constants.ts\nSTEP=20, UI_COLORS, etc.",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000pagesvelto",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### +page.svelte\nApp entry. `onMount` → `store.init()`\nShows loading/error, then mounts `<Canvas />`",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000types00000",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### types.ts\nTS interfaces mirroring Rust:\n`CanvasNode`, `Edge`,\n`Canvas`, `Config`"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000taurimock0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -410,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "### tauri-mock.ts\nBrowser dev mode:\nPatches `invoke()` with\nin-memory handlers"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000modesdiag0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "### Mode System\n```\nnormal ──[i]──→ insert ──[Esc]──→ normal\nnormal ──[m]──→ move   ──[Esc]──→ normal\nnormal ──[r]──→ resize ──[Esc]──→ normal\nnormal ──[c]──→ connect──[Enter]─→ normal\nnormal ──[v]──→ visual ──[Enter]─→ normal\nnormal ──[/]──→ search ──[Esc]──→ normal\nmove ←──[r/m]──→ resize (direct switch)\n```",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000000dataflow00",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 440,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "### Data Flow\n1. Startup → `invoke(\"init\")` → config + file_path\n2. Load → `invoke(\"read_canvas\")` → nodes/edges\n3. Edit → `pushSnapshot()` → mutate `$state`\n4. Auto-save → `debouncedSave()` (500ms)\n5. Save → `invoke(\"save_canvas\")` → Rust writes JSON\n6. Quit → immediate save → `window.close()`",
      "color": "2"
    }
  ],
